{"definitions":[{"fields":["count"],"name":"Counter","superclass":"Object"},{"fields":["storage","count"],"name":"STCompilerList","superclass":"Object"},{"fields":["characters","offset","line","column","nesting","tokenLine","tokenColumn"],"name":"STScanner","superclass":"Object"},{"fields":["scanner","current","lookahead","expressionDepth"],"name":"STCompiler","superclass":"Object"},{"fields":["dependents"],"name":"Model","superclass":"Object"},{"fields":["model"],"name":"Controller","superclass":"Object"},{"fields":["source","aspect","view","property","active"],"name":"UIBinding","superclass":"Object"},{"fields":["id","kind","title","text","x","y","width","height","minimized","minimumWidth","minimumHeight","maximumWidth","maximumHeight","frameRevision","stateRevision","nativeMinimumWidth","nativeMinimumHeight","nativeMaximumWidth","nativeMaximumHeight"],"name":"SystemWindow","superclass":"Model"},{"fields":["windows","activeWindow","nextID","screens","focusRevision"],"name":"DesktopModel","superclass":"Model"},{"fields":["id","x","y","width","height"],"name":"DisplayScreen","superclass":"Object"},{"fields":[],"name":"DesktopManager","superclass":"Controller"},{"fields":["enabled","mvcBindings","identifier","role","visible","minWidth","maxWidth","minHeight","maxHeight"],"name":"UIElement","superclass":"Object"},{"fields":["text"],"name":"UILabel","superclass":"UIElement"},{"fields":["title","action","command","selectionAction","selectionSource"],"name":"UIButton","superclass":"UIElement"},{"fields":["label","text","placeholder","mvcInputTarget","mvcInputSelector"],"name":"UITextField","superclass":"UIElement"},{"fields":["children","spacing","padding"],"name":"UIContainer","superclass":"UIElement"},{"fields":[],"name":"UIColumn","superclass":"UIContainer"},{"fields":[],"name":"UIRow","superclass":"UIContainer"},{"fields":[],"name":"UISpacer","superclass":"UIElement"},{"fields":["content"],"name":"UIWindow","superclass":"SystemWindow"},{"fields":["readOnly"],"name":"UICodeEditor","superclass":"UITextField"},{"fields":["items","selection","target","selector"],"name":"UIList","superclass":"UIElement"},{"fields":[],"name":"UISplit","superclass":"UIContainer"},{"fields":[],"name":"UIScroll","superclass":"UIContainer"},{"fields":["title"],"name":"UIMenu","superclass":"UIContainer"},{"fields":[],"name":"UIDivider","superclass":"UIElement"},{"fields":[],"name":"ToolServices","superclass":"Object"},{"fields":["contents"],"name":"TranscriptModel","superclass":"Model"},{"fields":["resultLabel","resultCaption"],"name":"DevelopmentWindow","superclass":"UIWindow"},{"fields":["editor"],"name":"WorkspaceWindow","superclass":"DevelopmentWindow"},{"fields":["classList","methodList","queryField","editor","className","selector","originalSource","header","hint","accept","versions","inspector","creation","nameField","fieldsField"],"name":"BrowserWindow","superclass":"DevelopmentWindow"},{"fields":[],"name":"TranscriptWindow","superclass":"DevelopmentWindow"}],"methods":{"BrowserWindow":{"acceptMethod":"acceptMethod\n    | outcome target |\n    target := self selectedClass.\n    (target isNil or: [ self primitiveSelected or: [ editor text size = 0 ] ]) ifTrue: [ ^ self ].\n    outcome := ToolVM compileSource: editor text in: target.\n    (outcome at: 1) ifTrue: [\n        selector := outcome at: 2.\n        originalSource := editor text.\n        self refreshTools.\n        self refreshEditor.\n        self result: (ToolVM success: className , ' » ' , selector)\n    ] ifFalse: [ self result: outcome ]","chooseClass:":"chooseClass: name\n    className := name.\n    self chooseMethod: nil.\n    self refreshTools","chooseMethod:":"chooseMethod: name\n    selector := name.\n    originalSource := selector isNil ifTrue: [ '' ] ifFalse: [ self selectedClass methodSourceAt: selector ].\n    originalSource isNil ifTrue: [ originalSource := '' ].\n    editor text: originalSource.\n    methodList selection: selector.\n    self refreshEditor","classForm":"classForm\n    | form buttons |\n    nameField := UITextField new label: 'Klassenname'; placeholder: 'Greeter'; yourself.\n    fieldsField := UITextField new label: 'Instanzvariablen'; placeholder: 'name age'; yourself.\n    buttons := UIRow new yourself.\n    buttons add: (UIButton new title: 'Abbrechen'; onClickSend: #hideCreation to: self; yourself).\n    buttons add: (UIButton new title: 'Anlegen'; role: #primary; onClickSend: #createClass to: self; yourself).\n    form := UIColumn new padding: 12; visible: false; yourself.\n    form add: (self heading: 'Eine neue Klasse'); add: nameField; add: fieldsField; add: buttons.\n    ^ form","createClass":"createClass\n    | outcome |\n    outcome := ToolVM createSubclass: nameField text fields: fieldsField text.\n    (outcome at: 1) ifTrue: [\n        self hideCreation.\n        self chooseClass: (outcome at: 2).\n        self newMethod ].\n    self result: outcome","draftChanged:":"draftChanged: aString\n    accept enabled: (className notNil and: [ self primitiveSelected not and: [ aString size > 0 ] ])","filter:":"filter: aString queryField text: aString. self refreshClasses","hideCreation":"hideCreation creation visible: false","initialize":"initialize\n    | split sidebar main toolbar classBar methodBar |\n    super initialize.\n    self kind: #browser.\n    self title: 'System Browser'.\n    className := 'Counter'.\n    classList := UIList new identifier: 'classList'; onSelectSend: #chooseClass: to: self; yourself.\n    methodList := UIList new identifier: 'methodList'; onSelectSend: #chooseMethod: to: self; yourself.\n    queryField := UITextField new placeholder: 'Klassen filtern'; onChangeSend: #filter: to: self; yourself.\n    editor := UICodeEditor new identifier: 'methodEditor'; label: 'Methodenquelltext'; onChangeSend: #draftChanged: to: self; yourself.\n    header := self heading: ''.\n    hint := self caption: ''.\n    accept := UIButton new title: 'Akzeptieren'; identifier: 'executeButton'; role: #primary; command: #acceptMethod; onClickSend: #acceptMethod to: self; yourself.\n    versions := UIButton new title: 'Versionen …'; identifier: 'methodVersionsButton'; onClickSend: #showVersions to: self; yourself.\n    toolbar := UIRow new padding: 12; yourself.\n    toolbar add: (UIColumn new spacing: 4; add: header; add: hint; yourself); add: UISpacer new; add: versions; add: accept.\n    classBar := UIRow new yourself.\n    classBar add: (self caption: 'KLASSEN'); add: UISpacer new; add: (UIButton new title: '+ Klasse'; onClickSend: #showCreation to: self; yourself).\n    methodBar := UIRow new yourself.\n    methodBar add: (self caption: 'INSTANZMETHODEN'); add: UISpacer new; add: (UIButton new title: '+ Methode'; onClickSend: #newMethod to: self; yourself).\n    sidebar := UIColumn new widthFrom: 195 to: 280; padding: 10; yourself.\n    sidebar add: classBar; add: queryField; add: classList; add: UIDivider new; add: methodBar; add: methodList.\n    main := UIColumn new spacing: 0; widthFrom: 335 to: nil; yourself.\n    creation := self classForm.\n    main add: toolbar; add: UIDivider new; add: creation; add: editor; add: UIDivider new; add: self resultPane; add: UIDivider new; add: self imageBar.\n    inspector := UILabel new role: #code; yourself.\n    split := UISplit new yourself.\n    split add: sidebar; add: main; add: (UIScroll new widthFrom: 150 to: 250; padding: 12; add: inspector; yourself).\n    self content: split.\n    self result: (ToolVM success: 'Bereit.').\n    self refreshTools.\n    self refreshEditor","newMethod":"newMethod\n    className isNil ifTrue: [ ^ self ].\n    self chooseMethod: nil.\n    editor text: 'newMethod' , ToolVM lineBreak , '    ^ self'.\n    self refreshEditor","primitiveSelected":"primitiveSelected\n    selector isNil ifTrue: [ ^ false ].\n    ^ self selectedClass isPrimitiveAt: selector","refreshClasses":"refreshClasses\n    | query |\n    query := queryField text.\n    classList items: (ToolVM classNames select: [ :each | query size = 0 or: [ each includesIgnoringCase: query ] ]).\n    classList selection: className","refreshEditor":"refreshEditor\n    | primitive name |\n    primitive := self primitiveSelected.\n    name := className isNil ifTrue: [ 'Klasse' ] ifFalse: [ className ].\n    header text: name , ' » ' , (selector isNil ifTrue: [ 'Neue Methode' ] ifFalse: [ selector ]).\n    hint text: (primitive ifTrue: [ 'Primitive · VM' ] ifFalse: [ 'Instanzmethode · mit ⌘S akzeptieren' ]).\n    editor readOnly: (primitive or: [ className isNil ]).\n    versions enabled: (selector notNil and: [ primitive not ]).\n    self draftChanged: editor text","refreshInspector":"refreshInspector\n    | target description |\n    target := self selectedClass.\n    description := target isNil ifTrue: [ '' ] ifFalse: [\n        'KLASSE IM BROWSER' , ToolVM lineBreak , className , ToolVM lineBreak ,\n        (target superclass isNil ifTrue: [ '' ] ifFalse: [ target superclass name asString ]) , ToolVM lineBreak ,\n        'Instanzvariablen: ' , target instanceVariableNamesText , ToolVM lineBreak , ToolVM lineBreak ].\n    inspector text: (description , 'GEMEINSAME VARIABLEN' , ToolVM lineBreak , ToolVM bindingSummary)","refreshTools":"refreshTools\n    | target textValue |\n    self refreshClasses.\n    target := self selectedClass.\n    target isNil ifTrue: [ methodList items: #() ] ifFalse: [ methodList items: target methodNames ].\n    methodList selection: selector.\n    (selector notNil and: [ target notNil ]) ifTrue: [\n        textValue := target methodSourceAt: selector.\n        (textValue notNil and: [ textValue ~= originalSource and: [ editor text = originalSource ] ]) ifTrue: [\n            editor text: textValue. originalSource := textValue. self refreshEditor ] ].\n    self refreshInspector","selectedClass":"selectedClass\n    className isNil ifTrue: [ ^ nil ].\n    ^ ToolVM classNamed: className","showCreation":"showCreation\n    nameField text: ''. fieldsField text: ''. creation visible: true","showVersions":"showVersions\n    (selector notNil and: [ self primitiveSelected not ]) ifTrue: [ ToolVM requestVersionsFor: className selector: selector ]"},"Controller":{"initialize":"initialize model := nil","model":"model ^ model","model:":"model: aModel model := aModel"},"Counter":{"add:":"add: amount count := count + amount","increment":"increment count := count + 1","initialize":"initialize count := 0","value":"value ^ count"},"DesktopManager":{"activate:":"activate: aWindow\n    aWindow minimized: false. model requestFocus. ^ self bringToFront: aWindow","activeWindow":"activeWindow ^ model activeWindow","append:":"append: aWindow\n    | replacement |\n    replacement := Array new: self windows size + 1.\n    1 to: self windows size do: [ :index | replacement at: index put: (self windows at: index) ].\n    replacement at: replacement size put: aWindow.\n    model windows: replacement. ^ aWindow","bringToFront:":"bringToFront: aWindow\n    model windows: (self windows select: [ :each | (each == aWindow) not ]).\n    self append: aWindow. model activeWindow: aWindow. ^ aWindow","chooseActive":"chooseActive\n    model activeWindow: nil.\n    self windows do: [ :each | each minimized ifFalse: [ model activeWindow: each ] ].\n    model requestFocus. ^ model activeWindow","close:":"close: aWindow\n    aWindow canClose ifFalse: [ ^ false ].\n    model windows: (self windows select: [ :each | (each == aWindow) not ]).\n    model activeWindow == aWindow ifTrue: [ self chooseActive ]. ^ aWindow","constrain:":"constrain: aWindow\n    | screen newX newY newWidth newHeight minWidth minHeight maxWidth maxHeight |\n    newX := aWindow x clampFrom: -100000 to: 100000.\n    newY := aWindow y clampFrom: -100000 to: 100000.\n    newWidth := aWindow width clampFrom: aWindow minimumWidth to: aWindow maximumWidth.\n    newHeight := aWindow height clampFrom: aWindow minimumHeight to: aWindow maximumHeight.\n    minWidth := aWindow minimumWidth. minHeight := aWindow minimumHeight.\n    maxWidth := aWindow maximumWidth. maxHeight := aWindow maximumHeight.\n    screen := self screenFor: aWindow.\n    screen notNil ifTrue: [\n        minWidth := minWidth min: screen width. minHeight := minHeight min: screen height.\n        maxWidth := maxWidth min: screen width. maxHeight := maxHeight min: screen height.\n        newWidth := newWidth min: screen width. newHeight := newHeight min: screen height.\n        newX := newX clampFrom: screen x to: screen x + screen width - newWidth.\n        newY := newY clampFrom: screen y to: screen y + screen height - newHeight ].\n    aWindow nativeMinimumWidth: minWidth height: minHeight maximumWidth: maxWidth height: maxHeight.\n    aWindow placeX: newX y: newY width: newWidth height: newHeight","createKind:title:":"createKind: aKind title: aTitle\n    | window |\n    self windows size >= 128 ifTrue: [ ^ nil ].\n    window := self windowClassFor: aKind.\n    window := window new.\n    window kind: aKind; title: aTitle.\n    aKind = #workspace ifTrue: [ window moveToX: 100 + (self windows size * 24) y: 200 + (self windows size * 24) ].\n    (aKind = #browser or: [ aKind = #changes ]) ifTrue: [ window moveToX: 850 y: 200; resizeWidth: 850 height: 650 ].\n    aKind = #transcript ifTrue: [ window moveToX: 100 y: 40; resizeWidth: 720 height: 200 ].\n    ^ self open: window","initialize":"initialize super initialize. model := DesktopModel new","minimize:":"minimize: aWindow\n    aWindow minimized: true.\n    model activeWindow == aWindow ifTrue: [ self chooseActive ]. ^ aWindow","nextID":"nextID ^ model nextID","observeActivation:":"observeActivation: aWindow\n    aWindow observeMinimized: false. ^ self bringToFront: aWindow","observeMinimized:value:":"observeMinimized: aWindow value: aBoolean\n    aWindow observeMinimized: aBoolean.\n    (aBoolean and: [ model activeWindow == aWindow ]) ifTrue: [ self chooseActive ]. ^ aWindow","open:":"open: aWindow\n    self windows do: [ :each | each == aWindow ifTrue: [ ^ self activate: aWindow ] ].\n    self windows size >= 128 ifTrue: [ ^ nil ].\n    aWindow id: model nextID. model nextID: model nextID + 1.\n    self constrain: aWindow.\n    self append: aWindow.\n    ^ self activate: aWindow","openBrowser":"openBrowser\n    | existing | existing := self windowOfKind: #browser.\n    existing notNil ifTrue: [ ^ self activate: existing ].\n    ^ self createKind: #browser title: 'System Browser'","openChanges":"openChanges\n    | existing | existing := self windowOfKind: #changes.\n    existing notNil ifTrue: [ ^ self activate: existing ].\n    ^ self createKind: #changes title: 'Codeänderungen'","openTranscript":"openTranscript\n    | existing | existing := self windowOfKind: #transcript.\n    existing notNil ifTrue: [ ^ self activate: existing ].\n    ^ self createKind: #transcript title: 'Transcript'","openWindow":"openWindow ^ self open: UIWindow new","openWorkspace":"openWorkspace ^ self createKind: #workspace title: 'Workspace'","requestClose:":"requestClose: aWindow ^ self close: aWindow","restoreWindows":"restoreWindows self windows do: [ :each | self constrain: each ]","screenFor:":"screenFor: aWindow\n    | best bestArea bestDistance area distance |\n    best := nil. bestArea := -1. bestDistance := 0.\n    model screens do: [ :screen |\n        area := screen overlapWith: aWindow. distance := screen distanceTo: aWindow.\n        (area > bestArea or: [ area = bestArea and: [ distance < bestDistance ] ]) ifTrue: [\n            best := screen. bestArea := area. bestDistance := distance ] ].\n    ^ best","screens":"screens ^ model screens","screensChanged:":"screensChanged: availableScreens\n    model screens: availableScreens. self restoreWindows","showWorkspace":"showWorkspace\n    | existing | existing := nil.\n    self windows do: [ :each | each kind = #workspace ifTrue: [ existing := each ] ].\n    existing isNil ifTrue: [ ^ self openWorkspace ].\n    ^ self activate: existing","windowAt:":"windowAt: anID\n    self windows do: [ :each | each id = anID ifTrue: [ ^ each ] ]. ^ nil","windowClassFor:":"windowClassFor: aKind\n    aKind = #workspace ifTrue: [ ^ WorkspaceWindow ].\n    aKind = #browser ifTrue: [ ^ BrowserWindow ].\n    aKind = #transcript ifTrue: [ ^ TranscriptWindow ].\n    ^ SystemWindow","windowOfKind:":"windowOfKind: aKind\n    self windows do: [ :each | each kind = aKind ifTrue: [ ^ each ] ]. ^ nil","windows":"windows ^ model windows"},"DesktopModel":{"activeWindow":"activeWindow ^ activeWindow","activeWindow:":"activeWindow: aWindow activeWindow := aWindow. self changed: #activeWindow","focusRevision":"focusRevision ^ focusRevision","initialize":"initialize\n    super initialize. windows := Array new: 0. activeWindow := nil.\n    nextID := 1. screens := Array new: 0. focusRevision := 1","nextID":"nextID ^ nextID","nextID:":"nextID: anID nextID := anID","requestFocus":"requestFocus focusRevision := focusRevision + 1","screens":"screens ^ screens","screens:":"screens: aList screens := aList. self changed: #screens","windows":"windows ^ windows","windows:":"windows: aList windows := aList. self changed: #windows"},"DevelopmentWindow":{"caption:":"caption: aString\n    ^ UILabel new text: aString; role: #caption; yourself","heading:":"heading: aString\n    ^ UILabel new text: aString; role: #heading; yourself","imageBar":"imageBar\n    | bar status save |\n    status := UIColumn new spacing: 3; yourself.\n    status add: (UILabel new role: #imageName; identifier: 'imageName'; yourself).\n    status add: (UILabel new role: #imageStatus; identifier: 'imageStatus'; yourself).\n    save := UIButton new title: 'Image speichern'; identifier: 'saveImageButton'; action: [ ToolVM requestSaveImage ]; yourself.\n    bar := UIRow new padding: 12; yourself.\n    bar add: status; add: UISpacer new; add: save.\n    ^ bar","result:":"result: outcome\n    | success |\n    success := outcome at: 1.\n    resultCaption text: (success ifTrue: [ 'ERGEBNIS' ] ifFalse: [ 'FEHLER' ]).\n    resultLabel role: (success ifTrue: [ #code ] ifFalse: [ #error ]).\n    resultLabel text: ((outcome at: 2) suffixFittingUTF8: 65536)","resultPane":"resultPane\n    | scroll |\n    resultCaption := self caption: 'ERGEBNIS'.\n    resultLabel := UILabel new role: #code; identifier: 'evaluationResult'; yourself.\n    scroll := UIScroll new padding: 12; spacing: 5; heightFrom: 72 to: 110; yourself.\n    scroll add: resultCaption; add: resultLabel.\n    ^ scroll"},"DisplayScreen":{"distanceTo:":"distanceTo: aWindow\n    | dx dy |\n    dx := (x * 2 + width) - (aWindow x * 2 + aWindow width).\n    dy := (y * 2 + height) - (aWindow y * 2 + aWindow height).\n    ^ dx squared + dy squared","height":"height ^ height","id":"id ^ id","overlapWith:":"overlapWith: aWindow\n    | overlapWidth overlapHeight |\n    overlapWidth := (((x + width) min: (aWindow x + aWindow width)) - (x max: aWindow x)) max: 0.\n    overlapHeight := (((y + height) min: (aWindow y + aWindow height)) - (y max: aWindow y)) max: 0.\n    ^ overlapWidth * overlapHeight","width":"width ^ width","x":"x ^ x","y":"y ^ y"},"Integer":{"clampFrom:to:":"clampFrom: lower to: upper ^ (self max: lower) min: upper","max:":"max: other self > other ifTrue: [ ^ self ]. ^ other","min:":"min: other self < other ifTrue: [ ^ self ]. ^ other"},"Model":{"addDependent:":"addDependent: anObserver\n    | replacement |\n    self dependents do: [ :each | each == anObserver ifTrue: [ ^ anObserver ] ].\n    replacement := Array new: dependents size + 1.\n    1 to: dependents size do: [ :index | replacement at: index put: (dependents at: index) ].\n    replacement at: replacement size put: anObserver.\n    dependents := replacement.\n    ^ anObserver","changed":"changed ^ self changed: nil","changed:":"changed: anAspect self dependents do: [ :each | each update: anAspect ]","dependents":"dependents dependents isNil ifTrue: [ dependents := Array new: 0 ]. ^ dependents","initialize":"initialize dependents := nil","removeDependent:":"removeDependent: anObserver dependents := self dependents select: [ :each | (each == anObserver) not ]"},"Object":{"initialize":"initialize ^ self"},"STCompiler":{"advance":"advance\n    current := lookahead.\n    lookahead := scanner nextToken","arrayElement":"arrayElement\n    | kind payload |\n    kind := self kind.\n    (#(integer string symbol identifier keyword) includes: kind) ifTrue: [\n        payload := self tokenValue.\n        self advance.\n        (#(symbol identifier keyword) includes: kind) ifTrue: [ ^ payload asSymbol ].\n        ^ payload ].\n    (kind = #binary and: [ self tokenValue = '-' ]) ifTrue: [ ^ self negativeNumber ].\n    (#(leftParen arrayStart) includes: kind) ifTrue: [ self advance. ^ self arrayElements ].\n    self fail: 'Literal oder ) im Array erwartet.'","arrayElements":"arrayElements\n    | elements |\n    elements := STCompilerList new.\n    [ self kind ~= #rightParen ] whileTrue: [ elements add: self arrayElement ].\n    self advance.\n    ^ elements elements","binaryExpression":"binaryExpression\n    | receiver |\n    receiver := self unaryExpression.\n    [ self kind = #binary ] whileTrue: [\n        receiver := self sendTo: receiver message: self binaryMessage ].\n    ^ receiver","binaryMessage":"binaryMessage\n    | selector |\n    selector := self tokenValue.\n    self advance.\n    ^ self pair: selector with: (self single: self unaryExpression)","blockAt:":"blockAt: position\n    | parameters body |\n    self advance.\n    parameters := STCompilerList new.\n    [ self kind = #colon ] whileTrue: [\n        self advance.\n        parameters add: self identifier ].\n    parameters := parameters elements.\n    parameters isEmpty ifFalse: [ self expect: #bar ].\n    self validateNames: parameters.\n    body := self bodyUntil: #rightBracket.\n    self validate: parameters separateFrom: (body at: 1) error: 'Blockargument ist auch als lokale Variable deklariert.'.\n    self expect: #rightBracket.\n    ^ self node: #block at: position with: parameters with: body","bodyUntil:":"bodyUntil: terminator\n    | temporaries expressions |\n    temporaries := STCompilerList new.\n    self kind = #bar ifTrue: [\n        self advance.\n        [ self kind = #identifier ] whileTrue: [ temporaries add: self identifier ].\n        self expect: #bar ].\n    temporaries := temporaries elements.\n    self validateNames: temporaries.\n    expressions := STCompilerList new.\n    [ self kind ~= terminator and: [ self kind ~= #end ] ] whileTrue: [\n        expressions add: self expression.\n        self kind = #period ifTrue: [ self advance ] ifFalse: [\n            self kind = terminator ifFalse: [ self fail: 'Zwischen Ausdrücken wird ein Punkt erwartet.' ] ] ].\n    ^ self pair: temporaries with: expressions elements","cascadeMessage":"cascadeMessage\n    self kind = #identifier ifTrue: [ ^ self unaryMessage ].\n    self kind = #binary ifTrue: [ ^ self binaryMessage ].\n    self kind = #keyword ifTrue: [ ^ self keywordMessage ].\n    self fail: 'Nach ; wird eine Nachricht erwartet.'","expect:":"expect: kind\n    self kind = kind ifFalse: [ self fail: (self tokenLabel: kind) , ' erwartet, gefunden: ' , (self tokenLabel: self kind) , '.' ].\n    self advance","expression":"expression\n    | result |\n    expressionDepth := expressionDepth + 1.\n    expressionDepth > 128 ifTrue: [ self fail: 'Ausdruck ist zu tief verschachtelt.' ].\n    result := self expressionNode.\n    expressionDepth := expressionDepth - 1.\n    ^ result","expressionNode":"expressionNode\n    | position name first messages |\n    position := current.\n    self kind = #caret ifTrue: [\n        self advance.\n        ^ self node: #returnValue at: position with: self expression with: nil ].\n    (self kind = #identifier and: [ (lookahead at: 1) = #assign ]) ifTrue: [\n        name := self identifier.\n        self advance.\n        ^ self node: #assignment at: position with: name with: self expression ].\n    first := self keywordExpression.\n    self kind = #semicolon ifFalse: [ ^ first ].\n    (first at: 1) = #send ifFalse: [ self fail: 'Vor einer Kaskade muss eine Nachricht stehen.' ].\n    messages := STCompilerList new.\n    messages add: (first at: 5).\n    [ self kind = #semicolon ] whileTrue: [\n        self advance.\n        messages add: self cascadeMessage ].\n    ^ self node: #cascade at: position with: (first at: 4) with: messages elements","fail:":"fail: message\n    self error: message line: (current at: 2) column: (current at: 3)","identifier":"identifier\n    | name |\n    self kind = #identifier ifFalse: [ self fail: 'Variablenname erwartet.' ].\n    name := self tokenValue.\n    self advance.\n    ^ name","initialize":"initialize ^ self","keywordExpression":"keywordExpression\n    | receiver |\n    receiver := self binaryExpression.\n    self kind = #keyword ifFalse: [ ^ receiver ].\n    ^ self sendTo: receiver message: self keywordMessage","keywordMessage":"keywordMessage\n    | selector arguments |\n    selector := ''.\n    arguments := STCompilerList new.\n    [ self kind = #keyword ] whileTrue: [\n        selector := selector , self tokenValue.\n        self advance.\n        arguments add: self binaryExpression ].\n    ^ self pair: selector with: arguments elements","kind":"kind\n    ^ current at: 1","method:":"method: input\n    | selector parameters body kind |\n    self start: input.\n    parameters := STCompilerList new.\n    kind := self kind.\n    kind = #identifier ifTrue: [ selector := self identifier ].\n    kind = #binary ifTrue: [\n        selector := self tokenValue.\n        self advance.\n        parameters add: self identifier ].\n    kind = #keyword ifTrue: [\n        selector := ''.\n        [ self kind = #keyword ] whileTrue: [\n            selector := selector , self tokenValue.\n            self advance.\n            parameters add: self identifier ] ].\n    selector isNil ifTrue: [ self fail: 'Methodenkopf erwartet, zum Beispiel increment oder add: amount.' ].\n    parameters := parameters elements.\n    self validateNames: parameters.\n    body := self workspaceBody.\n    self validate: parameters separateFrom: (body at: 1) error: 'Argument und lokale Variable haben denselben Namen.'.\n    ^ self triple: selector with: parameters with: body","negativeNumber":"negativeNumber\n    | number |\n    self advance.\n    self kind = #minimumMagnitude ifTrue: [\n        self advance.\n        ^ '-9223372036854775808' asIntegerOrNil ].\n    self kind = #integer ifFalse: [ self fail: 'Nach - wird eine Ganzzahl erwartet.' ].\n    number := self tokenValue.\n    self advance.\n    ^ number negated","node:at:with:with:":"node: tag at: position with: first with: second\n    | node |\n    node := Array new: 5.\n    node at: 1 put: tag; at: 2 put: (position at: 2); at: 3 put: (position at: 3).\n    node at: 4 put: first; at: 5 put: second.\n    ^ node","pair:with:":"pair: first with: second\n    | result |\n    result := Array new: 2.\n    result at: 1 put: first; at: 2 put: second.\n    ^ result","primary":"primary\n    | position kind payload node |\n    position := current.\n    kind := self kind.\n    (#(integer string symbol identifier) includes: kind) ifTrue: [\n        payload := self tokenValue.\n        self advance.\n        kind = #identifier ifTrue: [ ^ self node: #variable at: position with: payload with: nil ].\n        kind = #symbol ifTrue: [ payload := payload asSymbol ].\n        ^ self node: #literal at: position with: payload with: nil ].\n    (kind = #binary and: [ self tokenValue = '-' ]) ifTrue: [\n        ^ self node: #literal at: position with: self negativeNumber with: nil ].\n    kind = #minimumMagnitude ifTrue: [ self fail: 'Ganzzahl ist zu groß (64-Bit-Grenze).' ].\n    kind = #leftParen ifTrue: [\n        self advance.\n        node := self expression.\n        self expect: #rightParen.\n        ^ node ].\n    kind = #leftBracket ifTrue: [ ^ self blockAt: position ].\n    kind = #arrayStart ifTrue: [\n        self advance.\n        ^ self node: #literal at: position with: self arrayElements with: nil ].\n    self fail: 'Ausdruck erwartet.'","sendTo:message:":"sendTo: receiver message: message\n    ^ self node: #send at: receiver with: receiver with: message","single:":"single: first\n    | result |\n    result := Array new: 1.\n    result at: 1 put: first.\n    ^ result","start:":"start: input\n    expressionDepth := 0.\n    scanner := STScanner new.\n    scanner source: input.\n    current := scanner nextToken.\n    lookahead := scanner nextToken","tokenLabel:":"tokenLabel: kind\n    kind = #end ifTrue: [ ^ 'Ende des Quelltexts' ].\n    kind = #rightBracket ifTrue: [ ^ ']' ].\n    kind = #rightParen ifTrue: [ ^ ')' ].\n    kind = #bar ifTrue: [ ^ '|' ].\n    kind = #period ifTrue: [ ^ '.' ].\n    ^ kind asString","tokenValue":"tokenValue\n    ^ current at: 4","triple:with:with:":"triple: first with: second with: third\n    | result |\n    result := Array new: 3.\n    result at: 1 put: first; at: 2 put: second; at: 3 put: third.\n    ^ result","unaryExpression":"unaryExpression\n    | receiver |\n    receiver := self primary.\n    [ self kind = #identifier ] whileTrue: [\n        receiver := self sendTo: receiver message: self unaryMessage ].\n    ^ receiver","unaryMessage":"unaryMessage\n    ^ self pair: self identifier with: #()","validate:separateFrom:error:":"validate: names separateFrom: locals error: message\n    names do: [ :name | (locals includes: name) ifTrue: [ self fail: message ] ]","validateNames:":"validateNames: names\n    names do: [ :name |\n        ((name at: 1) isLowercase and: [\n            (#('self' 'super' 'true' 'false' 'nil' 'thisContext') includes: name) not ]) ifFalse: [\n                self fail: 'Variablennamen müssen klein beginnen und dürfen keine Pseudovariablen sein.' ] ].\n    1 to: names size do: [ :index |\n        1 to: index - 1 do: [ :earlier |\n            (names at: index) = (names at: earlier) ifTrue: [\n                self fail: 'Variablenname ist doppelt deklariert.' ] ] ]","workspace:":"workspace: input\n    self start: input.\n    ^ self workspaceBody","workspaceBody":"workspaceBody\n    | body |\n    body := self bodyUntil: #end.\n    self expect: #end.\n    ^ body"},"STCompilerList":{"add:":"add: element\n    | grown |\n    count = storage size ifTrue: [\n        grown := Array new: storage size * 2.\n        1 to: count do: [ :each | grown at: each put: (storage at: each) ].\n        storage := grown ].\n    count := count + 1.\n    storage at: count put: element","elements":"elements\n    | result |\n    result := Array new: count.\n    1 to: count do: [ :each | result at: each put: (storage at: each) ].\n    ^ result","initialize":"initialize\n    storage := Array new: 8.\n    count := 0","joinedString":"joinedString\n    ^ storage joinedStringFrom: 1 to: count"},"STScanner":{"advance":"advance\n    (self peek isLineBreak) ifTrue: [\n        line := line + 1. column := 1\n    ] ifFalse: [ column := column + 1 ].\n    offset := offset + 1","fail:":"fail: message\n    self error: message line: tokenLine column: tokenColumn","initialize":"initialize\n    offset := 1.\n    line := 1.\n    column := 1.\n    nesting := 0","isBinary:":"isBinary: character\n    ^ character notNil and: [ '+-*/\\~<>=@%,&?!' includes: character ]","isIdentifierPart:":"isIdentifierPart: character\n    ^ (self isIdentifierStart: character) or: [ character notNil and: [ character isNumber ] ]","isIdentifierStart:":"isIdentifierStart: character\n    ^ character notNil and: [ character isLetter or: [ character = '_' ] ]","nextToken":"nextToken\n    | character start |\n    self skipTrivia.\n    tokenLine := line. tokenColumn := column.\n    character := self peek.\n    character isNil ifTrue: [ ^ self token: #end value: nil ].\n    character isASCIIDigit ifTrue: [ ^ self readNumber ].\n    (self isIdentifierStart: character) ifTrue: [ ^ self readWord ].\n    start := offset.\n    self advance.\n    character = '''' ifTrue: [ ^ self token: #string value: self readString ].\n    character = '#' ifTrue: [ ^ self readSymbol ].\n    character = ':' ifTrue: [\n        self peek = '=' ifTrue: [ self advance. ^ self token: #assign value: nil ].\n        ^ self token: #colon value: nil ].\n    character = '.' ifTrue: [ ^ self token: #period value: nil ].\n    character = ';' ifTrue: [ ^ self token: #semicolon value: nil ].\n    character = '^' ifTrue: [ ^ self token: #caret value: nil ].\n    character = '|' ifTrue: [ ^ self token: #bar value: nil ].\n    character = '(' ifTrue: [ ^ self token: #leftParen value: nil ].\n    character = ')' ifTrue: [ ^ self token: #rightParen value: nil ].\n    character = '[' ifTrue: [ ^ self token: #leftBracket value: nil ].\n    character = ']' ifTrue: [ ^ self token: #rightBracket value: nil ].\n    (self isBinary: character) ifTrue: [\n        [ self isBinary: self peek ] whileTrue: [ self advance ].\n        ^ self token: #binary value: (characters joinedStringFrom: start to: offset - 1) ].\n    self fail: 'Unbekanntes Zeichen: ' , character","peek":"peek\n    ^ self peekAhead: 0","peekAhead:":"peekAhead: delta\n    | index |\n    index := offset + delta.\n    index > characters size ifTrue: [ ^ nil ].\n    ^ characters at: index","readIdentifier":"readIdentifier\n    | start |\n    start := offset.\n    [ self isIdentifierPart: self peek ] whileTrue: [ self advance ].\n    ^ characters joinedStringFrom: start to: offset - 1","readNumber":"readNumber\n    | start digits number |\n    start := offset.\n    [ self peek notNil and: [ self peek isASCIIDigit ] ] whileTrue: [ self advance ].\n    digits := characters joinedStringFrom: start to: offset - 1.\n    digits = '9223372036854775808' ifTrue: [ ^ self token: #minimumMagnitude value: nil ].\n    number := digits asIntegerOrNil.\n    number isNil ifTrue: [ self fail: 'Ganzzahl ist zu groß (64-Bit-Grenze).' ].\n    ^ self token: #integer value: number","readString":"readString\n    | pieces start |\n    start := offset.\n    pieces := nil.\n    [ self peek notNil ] whileTrue: [\n        self peek = '''' ifTrue: [\n            self advance.\n            self peek = '''' ifFalse: [\n                pieces isNil ifTrue: [ ^ characters joinedStringFrom: start to: offset - 2 ].\n                pieces add: (characters joinedStringFrom: start to: offset - 2).\n                ^ pieces joinedString ].\n            pieces isNil ifTrue: [ pieces := STCompilerList new ].\n            pieces add: (characters joinedStringFrom: start to: offset - 1).\n            self advance.\n            start := offset\n        ] ifFalse: [ self advance ] ].\n    self fail: 'String ist nicht geschlossen.'","readSymbol":"readSymbol\n    | start more |\n    self peek = '(' ifTrue: [ self advance. ^ self token: #arrayStart value: nil ].\n    self peek = '''' ifTrue: [ self advance. ^ self token: #symbol value: self readString ].\n    start := offset.\n    (self isIdentifierStart: self peek) ifTrue: [\n        [ self isIdentifierPart: self peek ] whileTrue: [ self advance ].\n        more := true.\n        [ more and: [ self peek = ':' ] ] whileTrue: [\n            self advance.\n            more := self isIdentifierStart: self peek.\n            more ifTrue: [\n                [ self isIdentifierPart: self peek ] whileTrue: [ self advance ] ] ].\n        ^ self token: #symbol value: (characters joinedStringFrom: start to: offset - 1) ].\n    (self isBinary: self peek) ifTrue: [\n        [ self isBinary: self peek ] whileTrue: [ self advance ].\n        ^ self token: #symbol value: (characters joinedStringFrom: start to: offset - 1) ].\n    self fail: 'Nach # wird ein Symbol oder ( erwartet.'","readWord":"readWord\n    | name |\n    name := self readIdentifier.\n    (self peek = ':' and: [ (self peekAhead: 1) ~= '=' ]) ifTrue: [\n        self advance.\n        ^ self token: #keyword value: (name , ':') ].\n    ^ self token: #identifier value: name","skipTrivia":"skipTrivia\n    | character |\n    [ character := self peek.\n      character notNil and: [ character isWhitespace or: [ character = '\"' ] ] ] whileTrue: [\n        character = '\"' ifTrue: [\n            tokenLine := line. tokenColumn := column.\n            self advance.\n            [ self peek notNil and: [ self peek ~= '\"' ] ] whileTrue: [ self advance ].\n            self peek isNil ifTrue: [ self fail: 'Kommentar ist nicht geschlossen.' ].\n            self advance\n        ] ifFalse: [ self advance ] ]","source:":"source: aString\n    characters := aString characters","token:value:":"token: kind value: payload\n    | token |\n    (#(leftParen leftBracket arrayStart) includes: kind) ifTrue: [\n        nesting := nesting + 1.\n        nesting > 32 ifTrue: [ self fail: 'Quelltext ist zu tief verschachtelt (maximal 32 Ebenen).' ] ].\n    (#(rightParen rightBracket) includes: kind) ifTrue: [ nesting := nesting - 1 ].\n    token := Array new: 4.\n    token at: 1 put: kind; at: 2 put: tokenLine; at: 3 put: tokenColumn; at: 4 put: payload.\n    ^ token"},"SystemWindow":{"activate":"activate ^ Desktop activate: self","canClose":"canClose ^ true","close":"close ^ Desktop requestClose: self","frameApplied:x:y:width:height:":"frameApplied: aRevision x: newX y: newY width: newWidth height: newHeight\n    frameRevision = aRevision ifTrue: [ self observeX: newX y: newY width: newWidth height: newHeight ]","frameRevision":"frameRevision ^ frameRevision","height":"height ^ height","id":"id ^ id","id:":"id: anID id := anID","initialize":"initialize\n    super initialize.\n    id := 0. kind := #workspace. title := 'Workspace'. text := ''.\n    x := 100. y := 200. width := 720. height := 600. minimized := false.\n    minimumWidth := 480. minimumHeight := 320.\n    maximumWidth := 8192. maximumHeight := 8192.\n    frameRevision := 1. stateRevision := 1.\n    nativeMinimumWidth := 480. nativeMinimumHeight := 320. nativeMaximumWidth := 8192. nativeMaximumHeight := 8192","kind":"kind ^ kind","kind:":"kind: aKind\n    kind := aKind.\n    minimumWidth := 320. minimumHeight := 160.\n    kind = #workspace ifTrue: [ minimumWidth := 480. minimumHeight := 320 ].\n    (kind = #browser or: [ kind = #changes ]) ifTrue: [ minimumWidth := 750. minimumHeight := 500 ].\n    kind = #transcript ifTrue: [ minimumWidth := 400. minimumHeight := 200 ].\n    frameRevision := frameRevision + 1. self changed: #kind. Desktop constrain: self","maximumHeight":"maximumHeight ^ maximumHeight","maximumWidth":"maximumWidth ^ maximumWidth","maximumWidth:height:":"maximumWidth: newWidth height: newHeight\n    maximumWidth := newWidth clampFrom: minimumWidth to: 8192.\n    maximumHeight := newHeight clampFrom: minimumHeight to: 8192.\n    frameRevision := frameRevision + 1.\n    Desktop constrain: self","minimized":"minimized ^ minimized","minimized:":"minimized: aBoolean minimized := aBoolean. stateRevision := stateRevision + 1. self changed: #minimized","minimumHeight":"minimumHeight ^ minimumHeight","minimumWidth":"minimumWidth ^ minimumWidth","minimumWidth:height:":"minimumWidth: newWidth height: newHeight\n    minimumWidth := newWidth clampFrom: 1 to: 8192.\n    minimumHeight := newHeight clampFrom: 1 to: 8192.\n    maximumWidth := maximumWidth max: minimumWidth.\n    maximumHeight := maximumHeight max: minimumHeight.\n    frameRevision := frameRevision + 1.\n    Desktop constrain: self","moveToX:y:":"moveToX: newX y: newY\n    x := newX. y := newY. frameRevision := frameRevision + 1.\n    Desktop constrain: self","nativeMinimumWidth:height:maximumWidth:height:":"nativeMinimumWidth: minWidth height: minHeight maximumWidth: maxWidth height: maxHeight\n    nativeMinimumWidth := minWidth. nativeMinimumHeight := minHeight.\n    nativeMaximumWidth := maxWidth. nativeMaximumHeight := maxHeight","observeMinimized:":"observeMinimized: aBoolean minimized := aBoolean. self changed: #minimized","observeX:y:width:height:":"observeX: newX y: newY width: newWidth height: newHeight\n    x := newX. y := newY. width := newWidth. height := newHeight.\n    self changed: #frame","open":"open ^ Desktop open: self","placeX:y:width:height:":"placeX: newX y: newY width: newWidth height: newHeight\n    (x = newX and: [ y = newY and: [ width = newWidth and: [ height = newHeight ] ] ]) ifFalse: [\n        frameRevision := frameRevision + 1 ].\n    x := newX. y := newY. width := newWidth. height := newHeight.\n    self changed: #frame","resizeWidth:height:":"resizeWidth: newWidth height: newHeight\n    width := newWidth. height := newHeight. frameRevision := frameRevision + 1.\n    Desktop constrain: self","stateRevision":"stateRevision ^ stateRevision","text":"text ^ text","text:":"text: aString text := aString. self changed: #text","title":"title ^ title","title:":"title: aTitle title := aTitle. self changed: #title","width":"width ^ width","x":"x ^ x","y":"y ^ y"},"Transcript":{"clear":"clear TranscriptBuffer clear","cr":"cr self show: ToolVM lineBreak","show:":"show: value\n    | text |\n    text := value class == String ifTrue: [ value ] ifFalse: [ value printString ].\n    self record: text.\n    TranscriptBuffer append: text"},"TranscriptModel":{"append:":"append: aString\n    | addition |\n    addition := aString suffixFittingUTF8: 65536.\n    contents := (contents suffixFittingUTF8: 65536 - addition utf8Size) , addition.\n    self changed: #text","clear":"clear contents := ''. self changed: #text","initialize":"initialize super initialize. contents := ''","text":"text\n    contents size = 0 ifTrue: [ ^ 'Transcript show: ''Hallo''; cr.' ].\n    ^ contents"},"TranscriptWindow":{"initialize":"initialize\n    | root toolbar output scroll |\n    super initialize.\n    self kind: #transcript.\n    self title: 'Transcript'.\n    toolbar := UIRow new padding: 12; yourself.\n    toolbar add: (self heading: 'Transcript'); add: UISpacer new.\n    toolbar add: (UIButton new title: 'Leeren'; onClickSend: #clear to: TranscriptBuffer; yourself).\n    output := UILabel new identifier: 'transcriptOutput'; role: #code; yourself.\n    output bind: #text to: TranscriptBuffer aspect: #text.\n    scroll := UIScroll new role: #followEnd; padding: 12; yourself.\n    scroll add: output.\n    root := UIColumn new spacing: 0; yourself.\n    root add: toolbar; add: UIDivider new; add: scroll.\n    self content: root"},"UIBinding":{"active":"active ^ active","aspect":"aspect ^ aspect","connect":"connect active ifTrue: [ ^ self ]. active := true. source addDependent: self. self update: nil","disconnect":"disconnect active ifFalse: [ ^ self ]. active := false. source removeDependent: self","initialize":"initialize active := false","property":"property ^ property","source":"source ^ source","source:aspect:view:property:":"source: aModel aspect: anAspect view: aView property: aProperty source := aModel. aspect := anAspect. view := aView. property := aProperty","update:":"update: anAspect\n    active ifFalse: [ ^ self ].\n    (anAspect isNil or: [ anAspect = aspect ]) ifTrue: [\n        view perform: (property asString, ':') asSymbol with: (source perform: aspect) ]","view":"view ^ view"},"UIButton":{"action:":"action: aBlock action := aBlock","click":"click enabled ifFalse: [ ^ self ]. action notNil ifTrue: [ ^ action value ]","clickWithSelection:":"clickWithSelection: aString\n    enabled ifFalse: [ ^ self ].\n    selectionAction isNil ifTrue: [ ^ self click ].\n    ^ selectionAction value: aString","command:":"command: aSymbol command := aSymbol","initialize":"initialize super initialize. title := 'Button'. action := nil","onClickSend:to:":"onClickSend: aSelector to: aController self action: [ aController perform: aSelector ]","selectionFrom:action:":"selectionFrom: anEditor action: aBlock selectionSource := anEditor. selectionAction := aBlock","title":"title ^ title","title:":"title: aString title := aString"},"UICodeEditor":{"initialize":"initialize super initialize. readOnly := false","readOnly:":"readOnly: aBoolean readOnly := aBoolean"},"UIContainer":{"add:":"add: anElement\n    | replacement |\n    replacement := Array new: children size + 1.\n    1 to: children size do: [ :index | replacement at: index put: (children at: index) ].\n    replacement at: replacement size put: anElement.\n    children := replacement.\n    ^ anElement","children":"children ^ children","children:":"children: anArray children := anArray","initialize":"initialize super initialize. children := Array new: 0. spacing := 8. padding := 0","padding":"padding ^ padding","padding:":"padding: aNumber padding := aNumber","remove:":"remove: anElement children := children select: [ :each | (each == anElement) not ]","removeAll":"removeAll children := Array new: 0","spacing":"spacing ^ spacing","spacing:":"spacing: aNumber spacing := aNumber"},"UIElement":{"bind:to:aspect:":"bind: aProperty to: aModel aspect: anAspect\n    | binding replacement |\n    self unbind: aProperty.\n    binding := UIBinding new.\n    binding source: aModel aspect: anAspect view: self property: aProperty.\n    replacement := Array new: self bindings size + 1.\n    1 to: mvcBindings size do: [ :index | replacement at: index put: (mvcBindings at: index) ].\n    replacement at: replacement size put: binding.\n    mvcBindings := replacement.\n    binding connect","bindings":"bindings mvcBindings isNil ifTrue: [ mvcBindings := Array new: 0 ]. ^ mvcBindings","enabled":"enabled ^ enabled","enabled:":"enabled: aBoolean enabled := aBoolean","heightFrom:to:":"heightFrom: minimum to: maximum minHeight := minimum. maxHeight := maximum","identifier:":"identifier: aString identifier := aString","initialize":"initialize enabled := true. visible := true. mvcBindings := nil","role:":"role: aSymbol role := aSymbol","unbind:":"unbind: aProperty\n    self bindings do: [ :each | each property = aProperty ifTrue: [ each disconnect ] ].\n    mvcBindings := mvcBindings select: [ :each | (each property = aProperty) not ]","unbindAll":"unbindAll self bindings do: [ :each | each disconnect ]. mvcBindings := nil","visible:":"visible: aBoolean visible := aBoolean","widthFrom:to:":"widthFrom: minimum to: maximum minWidth := minimum. maxWidth := maximum"},"UILabel":{"initialize":"initialize super initialize. text := ''","text":"text ^ text","text:":"text: aString text := aString"},"UIList":{"initialize":"initialize super initialize. items := #(). selection := nil","items:":"items: values items := values","onSelectSend:to:":"onSelectSend: message to: receiver target := receiver. selector := message","select:":"select: value\n    (value isNil or: [ items includes: value ]) ifFalse: [ ^ self ].\n    selection := value.\n    target notNil ifTrue: [ ^ target perform: selector with: value ]","selection:":"selection: value selection := value"},"UIMenu":{"initialize":"initialize super initialize. title := 'Menü'","title:":"title: aString title := aString"},"UITextField":{"editText:":"editText: aString\n    self text: aString.\n    mvcInputTarget notNil ifTrue: [ ^ mvcInputTarget perform: mvcInputSelector with: aString ]","initialize":"initialize super initialize. label := ''. text := ''. placeholder := ''","label":"label ^ label","label:":"label: aString label := aString","onChangeSend:to:":"onChangeSend: aSelector to: aController mvcInputTarget := aController. mvcInputSelector := aSelector","placeholder":"placeholder ^ placeholder","placeholder:":"placeholder: aString placeholder := aString","text":"text ^ text","text:":"text: aString text := aString"},"UIWindow":{"content":"content ^ content","content:":"content: anElement content := anElement","initialize":"initialize super initialize. self kind: #custom. title := 'Fenster'. width := 480. height := 320. content := nil"},"WorkspaceWindow":{"exampleButton:key:":"exampleButton: aTitle key: exampleKey\n    ^ UIButton new title: aTitle; action: [\n        | workspace |\n        workspace := Desktop openWorkspace.\n        workspace notNil ifTrue: [ workspace text: (ToolVM exampleAt: exampleKey) ] ]; yourself","examplesMenu":"examplesMenu\n    | menu |\n    menu := UIMenu new title: 'Beispiele'; yourself.\n    menu add: (self exampleButton: 'Zähler' key: #workspace).\n    menu add: (self exampleButton: 'Arrays und Blöcke' key: #collections).\n    menu add: (self exampleButton: 'Eine eigene Klasse' key: #classes).\n    menu add: (self exampleButton: 'Fenster öffnen' key: #windows).\n    menu add: (self exampleButton: 'Eigene Oberfläche' key: #userInterface).\n    ^ menu","execute:printing:":"execute: selected printing: aBoolean\n    | source outcome |\n    source := selected size = 0 ifTrue: [ self text ] ifFalse: [ selected ].\n    outcome := ToolVM evaluateSource: source.\n    self result: outcome.\n    (aBoolean and: [ outcome at: 1 ]) ifTrue: [ Transcript show: '→ ' , (outcome at: 2); cr ].\n    ^ outcome at: 2","initialize":"initialize\n    | root bar doIt printIt |\n    super initialize.\n    self kind: #workspace.\n    self title: 'Workspace'.\n    self resizeWidth: 720 height: 600.\n    editor := UICodeEditor new identifier: 'workspaceEditor'; label: 'Smalltalk Workspace'; yourself.\n    editor onChangeSend: #text: to: self.\n    doIt := UIButton new title: 'Do it'; identifier: 'executeButton'; role: #primary; command: #doIt; yourself.\n    doIt selectionFrom: editor action: [ :selected | self execute: selected printing: false ].\n    printIt := UIButton new title: 'Print it'; command: #printIt; yourself.\n    printIt selectionFrom: editor action: [ :selected | self execute: selected printing: true ].\n    bar := UIRow new padding: 12; yourself.\n    bar add: (self heading: 'Workspace'); add: UISpacer new; add: self examplesMenu; add: printIt; add: doIt.\n    root := UIColumn new spacing: 0; yourself.\n    root add: bar; add: UIDivider new; add: editor; add: UIDivider new; add: self resultPane; add: UIDivider new; add: self imageBar.\n    self content: root.\n    self result: (ToolVM success: 'Bereit. Auswahl oder gesamten Workspace mit ⌘D ausführen.')","text:":"text: aString\n    super text: aString.\n    editor notNil ifTrue: [ editor text: aString ]"}},"version":1}